{
    "title": "Boxed Up - The Sneaker Game",
    "description": "Love sneakers? Into collectible games? Obsessed with trading cards? Boxed Up combines it all! With over 10,000 unique collectible sneaker trading cards, updated weekly, you\u2019ll always be ahead of the game. From the latest kicks to hard-to-find classics, Boxed Up is the ultimate sneaker game and shoe collecting app for sneakerheads and collectors.\r\n\r\nHow to Play Boxed Up:\r\n\r\n\t\u2022\tCollect Sneakers & Trading Cards: Build your collection of the rarest and most exclusive sneakers and trading cards. New sneaker drops and limited-edition trading cards are available every week.\r\n\t\u2022\tPlay Mini Sneaker Games & Challenges: Test your sneaker knowledge, complete fun challenges, and compete in exciting collectible games to earn coins and gems.\r\n\t\u2022\tBuy, Sell, & Trade: Use the in-app marketplace to buy, sell, and trade sneakers or trading cards with other players. Secure rare items and complete your collection.\r\n\t\u2022\tExclusive Box Drops: Each week, get your hands on limited-edition, numbered sneakers and trading cards\u2014only available to a lucky few collectors!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\t\u2022\tDynamic Sneaker Trading Card Marketplace: Trade, buy, and sell with fellow sneakerheads and trading card collectors. Stay on top of the hottest sneaker game and collectible trends.\r\n\t\u2022\tWeekly Events & Drops: Take part in exclusive events and box drops for a chance to collect rare, limited-edition sneakers and trading cards.\r\n\t\u2022\tVersus Mode & Leaderboards: Compete against friends and others in the ultimate sneaker game showdown. Rise through the ranks to prove you\u2019re the top sneakerhead and card collector.\r\n\t\u2022\tComplete Scratch Cards: Unlock rewards like coins, gems, and rare trading cards by completing sets of your favorite sneakers.\r\n\t\u2022\tJoin the Community: Connect with over 11,000 members in our Discord community, where collectors trade, share strategies, and participate in special community events. Stay on top of the latest drops and trading card releases and be part of a passionate sneakerhead and trading card community!\r\n\r\nWhy Boxed Up?\r\nBoxed Up isn\u2019t just a sneaker game or a shoe collecting app; it\u2019s a full-fledged trading card game that blends sneaker culture with the excitement of collecting and trading. Whether you\u2019re a hardcore sneakerhead or a fan of collectible games and trading cards, Boxed Up delivers the ultimate experience for collectors.\r\n\r\nJoin our growing community of sneakerheads and trading card enthusiasts. Stay ahead of the latest sneaker game drops, trade your way to the top, and build the most prestigious collection of sneakers and trading cards!\r\n\r\nDownload Boxed Up now and start collecting the rarest sneakers and trading cards today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Love sneakers? Into collectible games? Obsessed with trading cards? Boxed Up combines it all! With over 10,000 unique collectible sneaker trading cards, updated weekly, you\u2019ll always be ahead of the game. From the latest kicks to hard-to-find classics, Boxed Up is the ultimate sneaker game and shoe collecting app for sneakerheads and collectors.<br><br>How to Play Boxed Up:<br><br>\t\u2022\tCollect Sneakers &amp; Trading Cards: Build your collection of the rarest and most exclusive sneakers and trading cards. New sneaker drops and limited-edition trading cards are available every week.<br>\t\u2022\tPlay Mini Sneaker Games &amp; Challenges: Test your sneaker knowledge, complete fun challenges, and compete in exciting collectible games to earn coins and gems.<br>\t\u2022\tBuy, Sell, &amp; Trade: Use the in-app marketplace to buy, sell, and trade sneakers or trading cards with other players. Secure rare items and complete your collection.<br>\t\u2022\tExclusive Box Drops: Each week, get your hands on limited-edition, numbered sneakers and trading cards\u2014only available to a lucky few collectors!<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\t\u2022\tDynamic Sneaker Trading Card Marketplace: Trade, buy, and sell with fellow sneakerheads and trading card collectors. Stay on top of the hottest sneaker game and collectible trends.<br>\t\u2022\tWeekly Events &amp; Drops: Take part in exclusive events and box drops for a chance to collect rare, limited-edition sneakers and trading cards.<br>\t\u2022\tVersus Mode &amp; Leaderboards: Compete against friends and others in the ultimate sneaker game showdown. Rise through the ranks to prove you\u2019re the top sneakerhead and card collector.<br>\t\u2022\tComplete Scratch Cards: Unlock rewards like coins, gems, and rare trading cards by completing sets of your favorite sneakers.<br>\t\u2022\tJoin the Community: Connect with over 11,000 members in our Discord community, where collectors trade, share strategies, and participate in special community events. Stay on top of the latest drops and trading card releases and be part of a passionate sneakerhead and trading card community!<br><br>Why Boxed Up?<br>Boxed Up isn\u2019t just a sneaker game or a shoe collecting app; it\u2019s a full-fledged trading card game that blends sneaker culture with the excitement of collecting and trading. Whether you\u2019re a hardcore sneakerhead or a fan of collectible games and trading cards, Boxed Up delivers the ultimate experience for collectors.<br><br>Join our growing community of sneakerheads and trading card enthusiasts. Stay ahead of the latest sneaker game drops, trade your way to the top, and build the most prestigious collection of sneakers and trading cards!<br><br>Download Boxed Up now and start collecting the rarest sneakers and trading cards today!",
